      "content": "It's completely understandable that you're feeling anxious with these new symptoms, but you absolutely must not stop or change your Adderall dosage without consulting your doctor. The combination of hyperthyroidism and stimulants can certainly increase jitters and heart rate, so you need a professional to monitor this for you. Please call your prescribing physician immediately to discuss how to safely manage your medication schedule alongside your new thyroid treatment.",
