    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should call them but i cant really get an appointment for like two weeks and i really need to get my work done. like, is there a way i can just adjust the dose myself? maybe like taking half the dose for a few days until my thyroid meds kick in and settle everything out? it seems like a reasonable way to manage the jitters without completely stopping it.",
