    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i understand but i just feel like i'm being too cautious. i've been taking the same amount of adderall for years with no issues until the thyroid thing. if i just take a small amount, like 5mg instead of my usual 20mg, it shouldn't be that bad right? it's just a little extra stimulation on top of a thyroid that's already acting up. would that be a safe way to bridge the gap until i see the doctor?",
